# Machine-local measurement stays local; the promotion loop's ledgers are
# repository memory and are tracked (observations feed candidates, decisions
# are the audit trail governance reads, harvests are what a port cycle
# measured in the source harnesses).
.harness/*
!.harness/observations/
!.harness/decisions/
!.harness/harvest/
*.swp
.DS_Store
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock
validation/
